+# Madeira Experimental
+
+An unofficial experimental derivative of [willfaust/Madeira](https://github.com/willfaust/Madeira), investigating Windows x64 Vulkan games on iPad through Wine, FEX and MoltenVK. Maintained by [Jelly-RayTian](https://github.com/Jelly-RayTian). Original Madeira history and attribution are retained.
+
+**Development source snapshot - not a finished Detroit: Become Human port.**
+
+## 中文说明
+
+这是基于 Madeira 的非官方实验分支，公开为底特律运行问题做的通用 Vulkan、内存、缓存及诊断修改，方便其他开发者复现和继续研究。
+
+此前较完整的实验包在 Apple M5 iPad 上进入过底特律着色器编译界面、主菜单和实际游戏场景，测试者确认可以操作镜头。编译很慢，后续仍出现管线/提交失败，尚不能称为稳定完整可玩。当前源码快照还包含之后加入的实验选项，不能把早期场景截图当作当前提交的完整实机验证。
+
+另一个精简包（上游 PR400 + PR399）已在实机通过真实 GPU 枚举、1024 字节图像读回及两轮红绿蓝呈现。该结果与此完整实验快照分开记录。
+
+- [完整构建、来源、验证范围和限制](docs/EXPERIMENTAL.md)
+- [上游构建依赖](docs/BUILDING.md)
+- [Vulkan 补丁和测试说明](build/vulkan-ios/README.md)
+- [低日志基础配置](examples/detroit-baseline.cfg)
+- [较新的整数输出实验配置](examples/detroit-integer-output-experimental.cfg)
+- [保留的上游 README](docs/UPSTREAM-README.md)
+
+本次先公开源码，不提供新的 IPA Release。仓库不是完整的一键构建环境，仍需准备上游原生库、工具链和运行资源。原有上游跟踪的二进制保留历史，但实验相关 DLL/原生库必须从对应源码重建。
+
+不包含底特律游戏 EXE/资源、私人日志、shader dump、证书、配对文件或账号信息。请自行提供合法持有的游戏。此项目不绕过 DRM 或 Steam 认证。
+
+## What is included
+
+- WineVulkan PE/Unix integration with real iOS CAMetalLayer surfaces and MoltenVK.
+- The broader fixed-address failure experiment and wait/session diagnostics.
+- Ten pinned MoltenVK compatibility/cache/compiler-observation patches, including opt-in unbound-input and integer-output experiments.
+- The local Wine diagnostic overlay as an applyable patch against the unchanged submodule pin.
+- Generic Windows x64 Vulkan callers and host/native readback tests.
+
+No FEX/DXMT source modifications or submodule pin changes are introduced by this snapshot. This is broader and less conservative than the changes proposed upstream; compatibility outside the tested workloads is not established.
+
+## Upstream contributions
+
+These separate PRs are smaller review units; they do not collectively represent all code in this experiment:
+
+- [Madeira #396](https://github.com/willfaust/Madeira/pull/396): narrow fixed-address reservation failure handling.
+- [Madeira #399](https://github.com/willfaust/Madeira/pull/399): optional SDK diagnostic field detection.
+- [Madeira #400](https://github.com/willfaust/Madeira/pull/400): default-off x64 Vulkan route and generic fixtures using official MoltenVK.
+
+The Vulkan route overlaps other upstream proposals; architecture coordination remains with Madeira's maintainers. This repository is an independent experiment, not evidence that upstream accepted these changes.
+
+## Licence
+
+See [LICENSE](LICENSE), [LICENSE-EXCEPTION.md](LICENSE-EXCEPTION.md) and [THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md](THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md). Madeira-side contributions are GPL-3.0-or-later with the Madeira Converter Exception; Wine and MoltenVK portions retain their respective LGPL-2.1-or-later and Apache-2.0 terms. Upstream notices are preserved. Prepared with AI assistance; real-device testing was performed by the contributor.
